<p class="lead">The Bear Alaskan XT is Bear Archery&rsquo;s answer to a simple request: one bow that is fast enough for elk country, forgiving enough for nervous shots and ready to hunt the day it arrives. With a 335 fps IBO rating, a 33-inch axle-to-axle frame and a 6.25-inch brace height, the Bear Alaskan XT RTH sits right in the middle of what most hunters actually need.</p>

<p>This review covers the full Bear Alaskan XT specs, how the DHC-XR cam behaves, what the Ready To Hunt package typically includes, and who should buy it. We also compare it with Bear&rsquo;s other RTH options, including the Species XT RTH and the Whitetail Maxx, so you can pick the right Bear Alaskan compound bow for the way you hunt.</p>

